    ethernet.ip.sctp.x2ap.id-SgNBtoMeNBContainer.ProtocolIE-Field.value.SgNBtoMeNBContainer.CG-Config.criticalExtensions.c1.cg-Config.scg-CellGroupConfig.RRCReconfiguration.criticalExtensions.rrcReconfiguration.secondaryCellGroup.CellGroupConfig.sCellToAddModList.Item 0.SCellConfig.sCellConfigCommon.downlinkConfigCommon.frequencyInfoDL.frequencyBandList.Item 0.FreqBandIndicatorNR = 41

ethernet.ip.sctp
